{
  "title": "Placement Group · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EC2 인스턴스의 물리적 배치 전략을 지정한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Placement Group</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#cluster-placement-group\">Cluster Placement Group</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#partition-placement-group\">Partition Placement Group</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#spread-placement-group\">Spread Placement Group</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#availability-zone-and-capacity\">Availability Zone and Capacity</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#placement-group-selection\">Placement Group Selection</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>36 / 62</span></div><h1>Placement Group</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 5 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Placement Group은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Instance의 물리적 배치 관계를 제어한다. 가까운 통신과 분리된 장애 경계 중 어떤 목표가 중요한지에 따라 Cluster, Partition, Spread를 선택한다.</p><p>구매 할인이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a> 정책이 아니라 배치 전략이다. 지원 Instance와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 제약이 있으며 이미 밀집된 그룹에 추가 용량을 요청하면 Capacity 오류가 날 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Latency와 장애 분리의 선택\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Latency와 장애 분리의 선택</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Low latency</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span> nodes</strong><small>노드 간 통신 집중</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#cluster-placement-group\">Cluster Placement Group</a></strong><small>한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에서 가까운 배치</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Fast communication</strong><small>용량·공통 장애 범위 고려</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Fault isolation</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Critical / Distributed nodes</strong><small>Hardware 장애 분리</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Spread / Partition</strong><small>개별 또는 그룹 단위 분리</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Resilience</strong><small>Workload의 복제 구조와 조합</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Spread는 개별 Instance, Partition은 여러 Instance 집합의 Hardware 분리다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Strategy</th><th scope=\"col\">배치 목표</th><th scope=\"col\">대표 사용</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cluster</td><td>가까운 통신</td><td>HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span></td></tr><tr><td>Partition</td><td>Partition 간 Rack 분리</td><td>Kafka / Hadoop</td></tr><tr><td>Spread</td><td>소수 Instance의 Hardware 분리</td><td>중요 서버</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cluster-placement-group\"><h2>Cluster Placement Group<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#cluster-placement-group\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 안에서 가까운 위치에 Instance를 모아 낮은 지연·높은 Network <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">Throughput</a>을 목표로 한다. HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span>·촘촘한 분산 계산에 적합하다. 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>로 분산하는 고가용성 전략과 목적이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"partition-placement-group\"><h2>Partition Placement Group<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#partition-placement-group\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>여러 논리 Partition으로 나누고 다른 Partition은 서로 Rack을 공유하지 않도록 배치한다. Hadoop·Kafka·Cassandra처럼 분산된 데이터 노드의 장애 영향을 제한할 때 사용한다. 같은 Partition 안의 노드는 물리 자원을 공유할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"spread-placement-group\"><h2>Spread Placement Group<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#spread-placement-group\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>작은 수의 중요한 Instance를 서로 다른 Hardware에 배치해 공통 실패 가능성을 줄인다. Rack-level Spread의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>당 Instance 수 등 제한을 확인한다. 많은 데이터 노드를 배치하는 Partition 방식과 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"availability-zone-and-capacity\"><h2>Availability Zone and Capacity<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#availability-zone-and-capacity\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Cluster는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 범위이며 Partition·Spread는 지원 조건에서 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 걸칠 수 있다. 그룹과 타입의 Capacity가 보장되는 것은 아니다. 필요한 Instance를 함께 시작하거나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>의 호환성을 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"placement-group-selection\"><h2>Placement Group Selection<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#placement-group-selection\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>낮은 통신 지연이면 Cluster, 대규모 분산 노드의 Rack 분리면 Partition, 소수 핵심 Instance의 Hardware 분리면 Spread를 비교한다. Software 복제·Quorum과 Placement 설계를 함께 맞춘다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Kafka Broker를 Partition으로 나누어 복제본이 다른 Partition에 위치하게 하면 한 Rack 장애가 모든 복제본에 미치는 위험을 줄인다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>Cluster는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 장애 분산 설계와 목적이 다르다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/placement-groups.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/placement-groups.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q028/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q028\" data-question=\"Q028\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q028</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q028/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which placement strategy reduces network latency among HPC nodes within one Availability Zone?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A spread placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances in different Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q028\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · Cluster는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 내 인스턴스를 가깝게 배치한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q029\" data-question=\"Q029\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q029</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q029/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to place a small number of critical EC2 instances on distinct underlying hardware. Which placement strategy should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q029\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Copy an AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q029\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q029\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 replication</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q029\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A spread placement group</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · Spread는 개별 인스턴스를 별도 기본 하드웨어에 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q030\" data-question=\"Q030\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q030</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q030/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to distribute many data processing nodes across isolated groups of underlying hardware. Which placement strategy should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q030\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A default network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q030\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q030\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A partition placement group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q030\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · Partition은 노드를 논리 파티션에 분산해 파티션 간 하드웨어 장애 영향을 분리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q032\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q046\" data-question=\"Q046\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q046</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q046/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company requires EC2 instances to run on hardware isolated from instances belonging to other AWS accounts. It does not need socket visibility, host affinity, or control over a specific physical server. Which option most directly meets these requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A cluster placement group in shared tenancy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q046\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Reserved Instances in shared tenancy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 다른 계정과 Hardware를 분리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>의 Host 제어가 필요하지 않은 요구와 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>는 그 자체로 Dedicated Tenancy를 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">이전 용어 <b>Object / File / Block</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">다음 용어 <b>QuickSight / Quick Sight</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
